window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"kennen","b":"masteryi","win":["Kennen","Kennen","Kennen","Kennen","Master Yi","Skill","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Levels 1-4","text":"Poke, marks, stun threat: this stretch is yours — and the third Mark cancels Meditate, his one way to heal the chip off."},{"when":"Yi level 6","text":"Highlander plus stacked Wuju flips the 1v1 — stop taking isolated duels immediately."},{"when":"First-item fights","text":"Your ult's stun-lock is the great equalizer — fights where it lands stay even or better despite his spike."},{"when":"Yi two-plus items","text":"His true damage deletes you in seconds — only fight from inside your team's peel."}],"wants":{"you":["Bully his melee levels hard","Cancel his Meditate with a Mark stun","Stay grouped once he spikes"],"foe":["Survive your poke to level 6","Isolate you in run-down duels","Delete you with late true damage"]},"early":"This is your stretch of the game and it is a wide one: shuriken poke, mark-stacking, and stun threat control levels 1 through 4-5, so chunk him relentlessly and deny CS. Bank the advantage now — every point of pressure here buys you safety against what is coming later.","mid":"The lane flips at his 6: Highlander plus stacked Wuju runs down an isolated Kennen, so stop dueling the moment he hits it. Around first items your R is the equalizer — a fight where your stun-lock lands stays skill-based — but pick those fights near allies, never alone in a side lane.","late":"Two-plus items his true damage simply deletes you, so your job is positioning, not bravery: stay grouped, flank only with an escape route, and hold your storm for the instant he jumps in. Stun-locked inside your team he dies; isolated against you, he wins every single time.","whys":["Your shuriken poke dominates his melee level 1.","Your ranged mark-stacking keeps control of level 2.","Your third Mark stuns him out of Meditate — his only heal, on 10s.","Poke still controls 4-5, but Wuju Style puts true damage on his autos every 14s — armour will not answer it.","At 6 his stacked Wuju spike and Highlander flip the isolated duel — he runs you down.","At first item your ult's stun-lock keeps his spike honest — a skill window either way.","At two-plus items his true-damage burst deletes your squishy frame."]});
